[{"answer":"Hello everyone.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, you're here because you're interested in travel, right?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/2.mp3"},{"answer":"And you're in the right place,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/3.mp3"},{"answer":"for at EasyTravel, we have the best deals for the best locations.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/4.mp3"},{"answer":"We specialise in eco-travel,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/5.mp3"},{"answer":"or holidays designed to get you amongst nature,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/6.mp3"},{"answer":"ignoring the hustle and bustle of big cities.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/7.mp3"},{"answer":"So, whether you want to hike in Nepal, as many people do,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/8.mp3"},{"answer":"or follow some jungle paths in the rainforests of Queensland,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/9.mp3"},{"answer":"we can give you the best deal.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/10.mp3"},{"answer":"If you look at our office here, you'll see our overseas consultants.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/11.mp3"},{"answer":"That's for trips overseas, obviously, to Europe, to North America,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/12.mp3"},{"answer":"but primarily for the Asian market,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/13.mp3"},{"answer":"which is generally more popular in this part of the world.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Most people like that touch of the Orient, right?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/15.mp3"},{"answer":"But they also like the domestic market,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/16.mp3"},{"answer":"since this country offers its fair share of beautiful natural vistas.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/17.mp3"},{"answer":"What about the deserts, anyone?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/18.mp3"},{"answer":"What about some striking red-rock gorges?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Then, talk to our domestic consultants, who can arrange anything you want.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/20.mp3"},{"answer":"But they deal with the accounts in the morning,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/21.mp3"},{"answer":"so you'll need to talk to them in the afternoon.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/22.mp3"},{"answer":"And remember, our office doesn't open at night, sorry to say.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/23.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, around the outskirts and outer regions of this city,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/24.mp3"},{"answer":"there are many beautiful places that you might not be aware of.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/25.mp3"},{"answer":"And the advantages of these regional locations are many.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Mostly, by being closer, some of them can be done in a day tour.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, it's fast and convenient, with none of those long-haul bus trips","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/28.mp3"},{"answer":"which often leave you cramped and uncomfortable,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/29.mp3"},{"answer":"and stuffing heavy suitcases into luggage racks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/30.mp3"},{"answer":"But, I should tell you about our buses,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/31.mp3"},{"answer":"those that are needed for the somewhat more distant holiday destinations.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/32.mp3"},{"answer":"They definitely do not suffer from those problems I just mentioned.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/33.mp3"},{"answer":"We use the services of the famous Sleek Line Company,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/34.mp3"},{"answer":"whose buses are known as the very best.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/35.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, they are big, yes, they are comfortable,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/36.mp3"},{"answer":"but what makes them especially different is the personal attendant,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/37.mp3"},{"answer":"who accompanies the driver, ready and willing to serve you,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/38.mp3"},{"answer":"and ensure that your trip is the very best.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/39.mp3"},{"answer":"So, whether it's overseas or local, we can certainly give you what you want.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/40.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, do you have any questions?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Right, let me orient you to our main EasyTravel office here.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/42.mp3"},{"answer":"On this table right beside us are travel magazines for you to browse through,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/43.mp3"},{"answer":"and on the wall next to that are many more, for all parts of the world.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Our four travel consultants sit over there, on the other side of that long counter.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/45.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right, four of them, side by side,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/46.mp3"},{"answer":"all serving various regions.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/47.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, let me tell you their specific functions.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/48.mp3"},{"answer":"Firstly, the consultant on the left, next to the plant,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/49.mp3"},{"answer":"is the 'Local Tours' consultant,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/50.mp3"},{"answer":"serving tours in the immediate vicinity of this city.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Next to her is what we call 'Regional Tours',","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/52.mp3"},{"answer":"targeting the state-wide options.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Next to her is the 'Interstate-Tours',","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/54.mp3"},{"answer":"and that can involve either buses or planes,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/55.mp3"},{"answer":"in the former case, utilising the SleekLine Bus service, as you know.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/56.mp3"},{"answer":"And finally, next to her, in the corner, is 'General Enquiries',","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/57.mp3"},{"answer":"which is self-explanatory.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/58.mp3"},{"answer":"If you have questions of a general nature,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/59.mp3"},{"answer":"rather than one relating to specific destinations, you can go there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/60.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, as I said, we can do international tours,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/61.mp3"},{"answer":"and for that you need our big office, just through that door -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/62.mp3"},{"answer":"the one between those two plants.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/63.mp3"},{"answer":"However, if your international tour is in the Asian region,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/64.mp3"},{"answer":"which is generally our most popular option,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/65.mp3"},{"answer":"then we deal with that in a separate room","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/66.mp3"},{"answer":"the one opposite International Tours, but not; the corner one.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/67.mp3"},{"answer":"Just go through that door on the left - the one next to that cupboard.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/68.mp3"},{"answer":"The door next to that is, in fact, our General Office,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/69.mp3"},{"answer":"so please don't go through there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/70.mp3"},{"answer":"That's reserved for staff members only.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/26-easytravel-travel-agency-2021-12-22-08-47-23/71.mp3"}]
